    <string name="dvd_ajustes_nota_converter">Convert saves the title as an MP4 in the Gallery, with all its audio tracks. Send streams the disc to another device (the Quall receiver, OBS) without recording, with the chosen audio track. They can’t run together: there’s only one drive.</string>
